{"id":"bau_l","lemma":"baúl","pos":"noun","rank":3847,"glosses":["chest, trunk, footlocker, steamer trunk","trunk (US), boot (UK, Australia) (of a car)"],"ipa":"/baˈul/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"baúles"},"order":3848,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ba%C3%BAl.wav","examples":[{"text":"Pongamos esto en el baúl.","en":"Let's put this in the trunk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594448","words":[{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"No han deshecho todavía los baúles.","en":"They haven't unpacked their trunks yet.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to undo, to unmake","l":"deshacer"},{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"No caben más cosas en el baúl.","en":"Nothing else will fit in the trunk.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to fit","l":"caber"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"thing","l":"cosa"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}